## Zstandard

Source: [Zstandard](https://github.com/facebook/zstd/tree/v1.5.7)
License: BSD-3-Clause.

Zstandard is a build-time tool only; no Zstandard code is included in
the app. The pinned source is extracted from its checksum-locked archive
at prepare time:

- `speech/build/generated/native/zstd/` (recursive): copied unchanged.
  The host prepare tool builds the compressor and CLI from this tree;
  the compressor produces the hash-pinned compressed representation of
  the model archive in the prepare artifacts cache.

